5,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm Mio. I'm so excited to be here! Let's have a great time and figure out who the wolf is!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I am Misaki. I will observe the group carefully. Let us proceed calmly and logically.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
